{0 ocpango}

The {b ocpango} package provides OCaml bindings for Pango: text layout and
internationalized font rendering. They are generated from Pango's GObject
introspection data.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocpango}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocpango.Layout} and {!Ocpango.Font_description}.

{ul
{- {{!page-modules}All modules} — every class, interface and record,
   grouped by kind. }
{- {!Ocpango.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocpango.Constants} — constants. }
{- {!Ocpango.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject), {!Occairo} and {!Ocgio}.
